item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2026-12202-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-no-parâmetro-css-class-name-do-endpoint-blocks&#34;&gt;CVE-2026-12202: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado no parâmetro &lt;code&gt;CSS class name&lt;/code&gt; do endpoint &lt;code&gt;Blocks&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publicação da CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-12202&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-12202&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;resumo&#34;&gt;Resumo
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Uma vulnerabilidade de Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado foi identificada no endpoint &lt;code&gt;Blocks&lt;/code&gt; da aplicação Subrion CMS. Essa vulnerabilidade permite que atacantes injetem scripts maliciosos por meio do parâmetro &lt;code&gt;CSS class name&lt;/code&gt;. Os scripts injetados são armazenados no servidor e executados automaticamente, representando um risco significativo de segurança.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;detalhes&#34;&gt;Detalhes
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Endpoint Vulnerável: &lt;code&gt;Blocks&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

item.content:encoded:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2026-12202-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-no-parâmetro-css-class-name-do-endpoint-blocks&#34;&gt;CVE-2026-12202: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado no parâmetro &lt;code&gt;CSS class name&lt;/code&gt; do endpoint &lt;code&gt;Blocks&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publicação da CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-12202&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-12202&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;resumo&#34;&gt;Resumo
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Uma vulnerabilidade de Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado foi identificada no endpoint &lt;code&gt;Blocks&lt;/code&gt; da aplicação Subrion CMS. Essa vulnerabilidade permite que atacantes injetem scripts maliciosos por meio do parâmetro &lt;code&gt;CSS class name&lt;/code&gt;. Os scripts injetados são armazenados no servidor e executados automaticamente, representando um risco significativo de segurança.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;detalhes&#34;&gt;Detalhes
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Endpoint Vulnerável: &lt;code&gt;Blocks&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parâmetro: &lt;code&gt;CSS class name&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;poc&#34;&gt;PoC
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;payload&#34;&gt;Payload
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-html&#34; data-lang=&#34;html&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;img&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;onerror&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;alert(&amp;#39;CVE-Hunters2&amp;#39;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;passos-para-reprodução&#34;&gt;Passos para Reprodução:
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Acesse o painel administrativo e clique em &lt;code&gt;&#34;Edit Blocks&#34;&lt;/code&gt;. Na página &lt;code&gt;&#34;Blocks&#34;&lt;/code&gt;, clique no botão &lt;code&gt;&#34;Add Block&#34;&lt;/code&gt; para configurar uma nova entrada. Insira o payload no campo &lt;code&gt;&#34;CSS class name&#34;&lt;/code&gt;, digite qualquer conteúdo nos outros campos e clique em &lt;code&gt;&#34;Add&#34;&lt;/code&gt;. O payload será ativado automaticamente:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/p/cve-2026-12202/image.png&#34;
	width=&#34;665&#34;
	height=&#34;398&#34;
	srcset=&#34;/p/cve-2026-12202/image_hu_2984c7c58cac0ae0.png 480w, /p/cve-2026-12202/image_hu_8a998a312d88a856.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;167&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;401px&#34;

 /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/p/cve-2026-12202/image-1.png&#34;
	width=&#34;690&#34;
	height=&#34;284&#34;
	srcset=&#34;/p/cve-2026-12202/image-1_hu_86e17d63b02dbe9d.png 480w, /p/cve-2026-12202/image-1_hu_2d7f2387cc2508c8.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;242&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;583px&#34;

 /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;impacto&#34;&gt;Impacto
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sequestro de sessão: Roubo de cookies ou tokens de autenticação para se passar por usuários.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roubo de credenciais: Coleta de nomes de usuário e senhas usando scripts maliciosos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distribuição de malware: Disseminação de código indesejado ou prejudicial para as vítimas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevação de privilégios: Comprometimento de usuários administrativos por meio de scripts persistentes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manipulação de dados ou desfiguração (defacement): Alteração ou interrupção do conteúdo do site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dano à reputação: Erosão da confiança entre usuários e administradores do site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;referência&#34;&gt;Referência
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/KarinaGante/KG-Sec/blob/main/CVEs/SubrionCMS/CVE-2026-12202.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://github.com/KarinaGante/KG-Sec/blob/main/CVEs/SubrionCMS/CVE-2026-12202.md&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;encontrado-por&#34;&gt;Encontrado por
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/karina-gante/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/assets/contributors/50x50/karina50x50.png&#34;



	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


 /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/karina-gante/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Karina Gante&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Por: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/CVE-Hunters/cve-hunters&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;CVE-Hunters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2026-11434-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-no-endpoint-adminblocks-via-blocks-plugin&#34;&gt;CVE-2026-11434: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado no endpoint &lt;code&gt;/admin/blocks&lt;/code&gt; via &lt;code&gt;Blocks Plugin&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publicação da CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-11434&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-11434&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;resumo&#34;&gt;Resumo
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Uma vulnerabilidade de Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado foi identificada no endpoint &lt;code&gt;/admin/blocks&lt;/code&gt; da aplicação FluentCMS. Essa vulnerabilidade permite que atacantes injetem scripts maliciosos por meio do &lt;code&gt;Blocks Plugin&lt;/code&gt;. Os scripts injetados são armazenados no servidor e executados automaticamente sempre que a página principal é acessada pelos usuários, representando um risco significativo de segurança.&lt;/p&gt;

item.content:encoded:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2026-11434-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-no-endpoint-adminblocks-via-blocks-plugin&#34;&gt;CVE-2026-11434: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado no endpoint &lt;code&gt;/admin/blocks&lt;/code&gt; via &lt;code&gt;Blocks Plugin&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publicação da CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-11434&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-11434&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;resumo&#34;&gt;Resumo
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Uma vulnerabilidade de Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado foi identificada no endpoint &lt;code&gt;/admin/blocks&lt;/code&gt; da aplicação FluentCMS. Essa vulnerabilidade permite que atacantes injetem scripts maliciosos por meio do &lt;code&gt;Blocks Plugin&lt;/code&gt;. Os scripts injetados são armazenados no servidor e executados automaticamente sempre que a página principal é acessada pelos usuários, representando um risco significativo de segurança.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;detalhes&#34;&gt;Detalhes
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Endpoint vulnerável: &lt;code&gt;/admin/blocks&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parâmetro: &lt;code&gt;Blocks Plugin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;poc&#34;&gt;PoC
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;payload&#34;&gt;Payload
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-html&#34; data-lang=&#34;html&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;img&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;onerror&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;alert(&amp;#39;CVE-Hunters&amp;#39;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;passos-para-reproduzir&#34;&gt;Passos para Reproduzir:
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Acesse o endpoint vulnerável e clique em &lt;code&gt;&#34;Add Block&#34;&lt;/code&gt; para configurar uma nova entrada. Insira o payload no campo &lt;code&gt;&#34;Content&#34;&lt;/code&gt;, digite qualquer informação nos outros campos e clique em &lt;code&gt;&#34;Submit&#34;&lt;/code&gt;. Acesse as páginas de pré-visualização via &lt;code&gt;&#34;/?pagePreview=1&#34;&lt;/code&gt;, arraste e solte o &#34;Block Plugin&#34; em qualquer lugar da página e selecione o bloco configurado anteriormente. Acesse a página principal e o script será executado automaticamente:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/p/cve-2026-11434/image.png&#34;
	width=&#34;470&#34;
	height=&#34;582&#34;
	srcset=&#34;/p/cve-2026-11434/image_hu_82c19b5aef121713.png 480w, /p/cve-2026-11434/image_hu_36e0d5133d913b63.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;80&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;193px&#34;

 /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/p/cve-2026-11434/image-1.png&#34;
	width=&#34;678&#34;
	height=&#34;533&#34;
	srcset=&#34;/p/cve-2026-11434/image-1_hu_71e2fb11fbe773fc.png 480w, /p/cve-2026-11434/image-1_hu_b9c46901039d81ea.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;127&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;305px&#34;

 /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/p/cve-2026-11434/image-2.png&#34;
	width=&#34;702&#34;
	height=&#34;278&#34;
	srcset=&#34;/p/cve-2026-11434/image-2_hu_673183fa472bd83c.png 480w, /p/cve-2026-11434/image-2_hu_5dce9ba0cd105845.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;252&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;606px&#34;

 /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;impacto&#34;&gt;Impacto
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sequestro de sessão: Roubo de cookies ou tokens de autenticação para se passar por usuários.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roubo de credenciais: Coleta de nomes de usuário e senhas usando scripts maliciosos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distribuição de malware: Disseminação de código indesejado ou prejudicial para as vítimas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevação de privilégios: Comprometimento de usuários administrativos por meio de scripts persistentes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manipulação de dados ou desfiguração (defacement): Alteração ou interrupção do conteúdo do site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dano à reputação: Erosão da confiança entre usuários e administradores do site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;referência&#34;&gt;Referência
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/KarinaGante/KG-Sec/blob/main/CVEs/FluentCMS/CVE-2026-11434.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://github.com/KarinaGante/KG-Sec/blob/main/CVEs/FluentCMS/CVE-2026-11434.md&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;encontrado-por&#34;&gt;Encontrado por
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/karina-gante/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/assets/contributors/50x50/karina50x50.png&#34;



	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


 /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/karina-gante/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Karina Gante&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Por: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/CVE-Hunters/cve-hunters&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;CVE-Hunters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2026-6990-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-em-novo-da-função-sigawfappresponsavelnovo-parâmetro-descrição&#34;&gt;CVE-2026-6990: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) armazenado em Novo da função &lt;code&gt;/sigawf/app/responsavel/novo&lt;/code&gt; parâmetro &lt;code&gt;Descrição&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publicação CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-6990&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-6990&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;##Resumo&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Uma vulnerabilidade de Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) armazenada foi identificada no endpoint &lt;code&gt;/sigawf/app/responsavel/novo&lt;/code&gt; do aplicativo SIGA. Essa vulnerabilidade permite que atacantes injetem scripts maliciosos no parâmetro &lt;code&gt;Descrição&lt;/code&gt;. Os scripts injetados são armazenados no servidor e executados automaticamente sempre que a página &lt;code&gt;/sigawf/app/responsavel/listar&lt;/code&gt; é acessada pelos usuários, representando um risco de segurança significativo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;detalhes&#34;&gt;Detalhes
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Endpoint vulnerável: &lt;code&gt;/sigawf/app/responsavel/novo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

