item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-9721-múltiplos-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-no-endpoint-formulamediaedit&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-9721: Múltiplos Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado no endpoint &lt;code&gt;FormulaMedia/edit&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publicação CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-9721&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
