&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publicação CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-9722&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
