item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-9388-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-no-endpoint-watch_listshtm-parâmetro-name&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-9388: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado no endpoint &lt;code&gt;watch_list.shtm&lt;/code&gt; parâmetro &lt;code&gt;name&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publicação CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-9388&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-9388&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;resumo&#34;&gt;Resumo
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Uma vulnerabilidade de XSS (Cross-Site Scripting Armazenado) foi identificada no endpoint &lt;code&gt;watch_list.shtm&lt;/code&gt; do aplicativo Scada-LTS. Essa vulnerabilidade permite que invasores injetem scripts maliciosos no parâmetro &lt;code&gt;name&lt;/code&gt;. Os scripts injetados são armazenados no servidor e executados automaticamente sempre que a página afetada é acessada pelos usuários, representando um risco de segurança significativo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;detalhes&#34;&gt;Detalhes
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Endpoint Vulnerável: &lt;code&gt;watch_list.shtm&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

