item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-7867-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-no-endpoint-agendaphp-parâmetro-agenda_rap_titulo&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-7867: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado no endpoint &lt;code&gt;agenda.php&lt;/code&gt; parâmetro &lt;code&gt;agenda_rap_titulo&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Publicação CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-7867&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-7867&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;resumo&#34;&gt;Resumo
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Uma vulnerabilidade de XSS (Cross-Site Scripting Armazenado) foi identificada no endpoint &lt;code&gt;agenda.php&lt;/code&gt; do aplicativo i-Educar. Essa vulnerabilidade permite que invasores injetem scripts maliciosos no parâmetro &lt;code&gt;agenda_rap_titulo&lt;/code&gt;. Os scripts injetados são armazenados no servidor e executados automaticamente sempre que a página afetada é acessada pelos usuários, representando um risco de segurança significativo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;detalhes&#34;&gt;Detalhes
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Endpoint Vulnerável: &lt;code&gt;agenda.php&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

item.content:encoded:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-7867-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-no-endpoint-agendaphp-parâmetro-agenda_rap_titulo&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-7867: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado no endpoint &lt;code&gt;agenda.php&lt;/code&gt; parâmetro &lt;code&gt;agenda_rap_titulo&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Publicação CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-7867&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-7867&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;resumo&#34;&gt;Resumo
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;Uma vulnerabilidade de XSS (Cross-Site Scripting Armazenado) foi identificada no endpoint &lt;code&gt;agenda.php&lt;/code&gt; do aplicativo i-Educar. Essa vulnerabilidade permite que invasores injetem scripts maliciosos no parâmetro &lt;code&gt;agenda_rap_titulo&lt;/code&gt;. Os scripts injetados são armazenados no servidor e executados automaticamente sempre que a página afetada é acessada pelos usuários, representando um risco de segurança significativo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;detalhes&#34;&gt;Detalhes
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Endpoint Vulnerável: &lt;code&gt;agenda.php&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parâmetro: &lt;code&gt;agenda_rap_titulo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&#34;text-align: justify;&#34;&gt;O aplicativo não consegue validar e sanitizar adequadamente as entradas do usuário no parâmetro &lt;code&gt;agenda_rap_titulo&lt;/code&gt;. Essa falta de validação permite que invasores injetem scripts maliciosos, que são armazenados no servidor. Sempre que a página afetada é acessada, o payload malicioso é executado no navegador da vítima, potencialmente comprometendo os dados e o sistema do usuário.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;poc&#34;&gt;PoC
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;payload&#34;&gt;Payload:
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-javascript&#34; data-lang=&#34;javascript&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;script&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;alert&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;PoC VulDB i-Educar PaCXXX&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;/script&amp;gt; &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/p/cve-2025-7867/image.png&#34;
