&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/%20%20www.linkedin.com/in/raul-pazem%C3%A9cxas-04882b21a/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
