item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-53934-cross-site-scripting-xss-armazenado-no-endpoint-controlphp-parâmetro-descricao_emergencia&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-53934: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Armazenado no endpoint &lt;code&gt;control.php&lt;/code&gt; parâmetro &lt;code&gt;descricao_emergencia&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Publicação CVE: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-53934&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
