item.description:
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cve-2025-53377-cross-site-scripting-xss-refletido-no-endpoint-cadastro_dependente_pessoa_novaphp-parâmetro-id_funcionario&#34;&gt;CVE-2025-53377: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Refletido no endpoint &lt;code&gt;cadastro_dependente_pessoa_nova.php&lt;/code&gt; parâmetro &lt;code&gt;id_funcionario&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
