&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/LabRedesCefetRJ/WeGIA/security/advisories/GHSA-qgrq-qjq6-h6gj&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
