&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/nmmorette&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/assets/contributors/50x50/natan50x50.png&#34;



	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


 /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/nmmorette&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Natan Maia Morette&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;colaboradora&#34;&gt;Colaboradora
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/karina-gante/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/assets/contributors/50x50/karina50x50.png&#34;



	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


 /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/karina-gante/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Karina Gante&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;parceria&#34;&gt;Parceria
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hacktiba.github.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/assets/partners/hacktiba60x60.png&#34;



	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;


 /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Esse post foi feito em parceria com &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://hacktiba.github.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Hacktiba&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; para o Pulse 07.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Por: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/Sec-Dojo-Cyber-House/cve-hunters&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;CVE-Hunters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
